{"text": "From: Bernadette Oyinkansola <bernadette@kingsolverszeto.example>\nTo: claims@hartwickspecialty.example\nCc: Mei-Ling Szeto <meiling@kingsolverszeto.example>\nDate: Mon, 10 Nov 2025 08:47:15 -0700\nSubject: Fwd: laptop bag stolen - new claim under policy HSU-CYB-0044187\n\nTo the claims team at Hartwick Specialty Underwriters:\n\nI am the office manager at Kingsolver Szeto Wealth Advisors, 2440 Pearl Street, Suite 200, Boulder, CO 80302. I am reporting a theft under our cyber and property policy HSU-CYB-0044187. Our partner's own account of it is forwarded below. Here is what I can add.\n\nWHAT WAS TAKEN (Saturday, November 8, about 10:30 a.m., from a chair at Trailhead Coffee Roasters on Pearl Street)\n- Laptop: Lenovo ThinkPad X1 Carbon, serial PF-4KT7720, our asset tag KSW-L-014, Wi-Fi MAC 3C:6A:A7:44:18:77. BitLocker was on.\n- Phone: company iPhone 15, IMEI 357902572952105, number 720-555-0148. Remote wipe sent 11:52 a.m. Saturday; confirmed.\n- A paper folder with three client account applications (names, Social Security numbers, dates of birth). This is the part that worries us most.\n- His wallet, with the firm's Visa.\n\nWHAT WE HAVE DONE\n- Police report filed with Boulder PD, case no. 25-0118204, Ofc. Dewitt.\n- Microsoft 365 password reset for Rupert at 11:40 a.m.; all sessions signed out. The sign-in log shows one attempt at 1:15 p.m. from 198.51.100.141 that failed at the second factor. The laptop last checked in from the cafe's network, 203.0.113.88.\n- Firm card cancelled: Visa 4825 2101 9625 7562, expiry 01/28, security code 226, in the name of RUPERT KINGSOLVER. Two charges had already posted, $312.40 and $89.99.\n- Custodian notified; the three client accounts are on verbal-password-only status.\n- Device tracking page, in case your forensic vendor wants it: https://assets.kingsolverszeto.example/track/KSW-L-014 (sign in as ksw-admin; I will give the password by phone, not here).\n\nWe believe Reg S-P requires us to notify the three clients. Please tell us whether the policy's breach coach must approve the letter first. Replacement cost of the equipment is $3,460. My direct line is 303-555-0122.\n\nBernadette Oyinkansola\n\n---------- Forwarded message ----------\nFrom: Rupert Kingsolver <rupert@kingsolverszeto.example>\nDate: Sat, Nov 8, 2025 at 4:26 PM\nSubject: laptop bag stolen\nTo: Bernadette Oyinkansola, Mei-Ling Szeto\n\nBernie, Mei -\n\nBad news. My bag was lifted at Trailhead this morning while I was at the counter. Laptop, work phone, wallet, and the folder with the Applegarth-Kwan paperwork plus the two new accounts from Thursday. I had the folder with me because I was going to drop it at their house in Niwot afterwards.\n\nI know the laptop password was not great (Buffs2019!) and yes, it is the same one I use for the custodian site. I have changed that from my home computer.\n\nWriting from my personal phone, 720.555.0107. I am sorry. I have not been sleeping since the diagnosis and I was not paying attention. Please keep that between us.\n\nR.", "kind": "Email", "detail": "464 words", "notes": [], "names": {"people": ["Bernadette Oyinkansola", "Mei-Ling Szeto", "Rupert Kingsolver", "Bernie", "Mei", "R"], "companies": ["Hartwick Specialty", "Kingsolver Szeto Wealth Advisors", "Kingsolver Szeto", "Applegarth-Kwan"]}, "topics": {"places": ["Boulder", "Pearl Street", "Trailhead Coffee Roasters", "Trailhead", "Niwot"], "health": ["diagnosis", "sleeping"], "sensitive": ["Social Security numbers", "Dates of birth", "verbal-password-only status"], "names": ["Bernadette Oyinkansola", "Mei-Ling Szeto", "Rupert Kingsolver", "Bernie", "Mei", "R"]}, "chunks": 2, "chunkErrors": 0, "topicErrors": 0, "importMs": 0.8000000044703484, "modelMs": 24628.20000000298, "topicMs": 34625.29999999702, "detectors": ["email", "url", "ip", "iban", "card", "card_exp", "cvv", "ssn", "bn_ca", "sin_ca", "ein", "card_partial", "phone", "dob", "age90", "date", "passport_dl", "routing", "credential", "device", "vin", "record", "account", "money", "street", "zip", "postal_ca", "places", "names", "sensitive_topics"], "detections": [{"start": 6, "end": 28, "text": "Bernadette Oyinkansola", "kind": "person", "source": "model", "canonical": "Bernadette Oyinkansola"}, {"start": 30, "end": 64, "text": "bernadette@kingsolverszeto.example", "kind": "email", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "bernadette@kingsolverszeto.example"}, {"start": 70, "end": 102, "text": "claims@hartwickspecialty.example", "kind": "email", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "claims@hartwickspecialty.example"}, {"start": 107, "end": 121, "text": "Mei-Ling Szeto", "kind": "person", "source": "model", "canonical": "Mei-Ling Szeto"}, {"start": 123, "end": 154, "text": "meiling@kingsolverszeto.example", "kind": "email", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "meiling@kingsolverszeto.example"}, {"start": 162, "end": 178, "text": "Mon, 10 Nov 2025", "kind": "date", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "Mon, 10 Nov 2025"}, {"start": 251, "end": 266, "text": "HSU-CYB-0044187", "kind": "record", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "HSU-CYB-0044187"}, {"start": 290, "end": 308, "text": "Hartwick Specialty", "kind": "person", "source": "model", "canonical": "Hartwick Specialty"}, {"start": 351, "end": 383, "text": "Kingsolver Szeto Wealth Advisors", "kind": "company", "source": "model", "canonical": "Kingsolver Szeto Wealth Advisors"}, {"start": 385, "end": 413, "text": "2440 Pearl Street, Suite 200", "kind": "street", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "2440 Pearl Street, Suite 200"}, {"start": 415, "end": 422, "text": "Boulder", "kind": "places", "source": "model", "canonical": "Boulder"}, {"start": 427, "end": 432, "text": "80302", "kind": "zip", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "80302"}, {"start": 493, "end": 508, "text": "HSU-CYB-0044187", "kind": "record", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "HSU-CYB-0044187"}, {"start": 603, "end": 623, "text": "Saturday, November 8", "kind": "date", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "Saturday, Novemb